  "description": "POCO DTOs and response envelopes for CPlugin WebAPI, the REST API that works with MetaTrader 4 and MetaTrader 5 servers. Zero dependencies beyond System.Text.Json; use it when you build your own HTTP layer. MetaTrader is a trademark of MetaQuotes Ltd.; this package is not affiliated with MetaQuotes.",
