  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0: v2 surface parity — 45 new MT5 operations (clients, deals, orders, positions, history, users, symbols, dealer balance) and the returned MT4 configuration operations (CfgRequestCommon, CfgRequestGroup, CfgRequestSymbolGroup, CfgUpdateGroup, UsersGet), MT5 names aligned with the platform (TimeServer, OrderGetByGroup, DealRequestByGroup, PositionRequestByGroup), update bodies send only the fields that are set, per-platform SignalR connection-status handlers (OnMT4ConnectionStatus / OnMT5ConnectionStatus); specification refreshed — 224 operations. Breaking changes are listed in the changelog. Full notes: https://github.com/CPlugin/mywebapi.com-sdk-dotnet/blob/v0.4.0/CHANGELOG.md",
